&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;MKTQ427R52&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: San Francisco, CA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Chief of Staff to the CMO to provide business leadership and establish operational rigor for the Databricks Marketing organization and support our mission to be the leading enterprise Data + AI company. You will develop an understanding of strategic and operational challenges faced by teams and define appropriate solutions to address such challenges. As a member of the leadership team, directly reporting to the CMO, you will extend the reach of the CMO by acting as a strategic advisor to the Marketing leadership team and managing all the critical business operations of the CMO office, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;investment stewardship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;annual strategic planning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;company priority initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;marketing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;executive presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;marketing performance (ROI) management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;organizational strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;internal marketing communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Databricks&#39; company strategy into Marketing annual plans, OKRs, and strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing alignment and execution by driving company priority and marketing priority initiatives across a 250-person Marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and lead cross-functional process improvements that deliver on company-wide efficiency and profitability goals, most notably our AI transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate decision-making velocity by owning critical CMO forums (e.g., Marketing leadership, Marketing strategy), running high-impact agendas and follow-through on all action items&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase planning and analytic rigor; improve Marketing ROI and efficiency year-on-year in line with the company’s rapid growth goals, and in partnership with Analytics and Finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing-wide and cross-functional alignment by driving CMO communications and exec presentations, including driving All-Staff meetings and quarterly business reviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of marketing experience, ideally including recent experience at Director level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B experience working at a dynamic, high-growth software company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in AI and ideally experience transforming marketing functions with AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in analytics and data-driven decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience leading strategic and annual planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant project management and OKR leadership skills, with experience in achieving quantifiable results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication and relationship-building skills with Senior Leadership and C-Level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in organizational structure improvement and process optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with an Analytic Consulting firm is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Chief of Staff nice to have, not essential&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Range Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Databricks is committed to fair and equitable compensation practices. The pay range(s) for this role is listed below and represents the expected salary range for non-commissionable roles or on-target earnings for commissionable roles.&amp;nbsp; Actual compensation packages are based on several factors that are unique to each candidate, including but not limited to job-related skills, depth of experience, relevant certifications and training, and specific work location. Based on the factors above, Databricks anticipates utilizing the full width of the range. The total compensation package for this position may also include eligibility for annual performance bonus, equity, and the benefits listed above. For more information regarding which range your location is in visit our page &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/sites/default/files/2024-08/us-pay-zone-mapping.pdf&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$221,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$305,150 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Req ID: CSQ427R266&lt;br&gt;Location: Tokyo, Japan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricksは、お客様がAIプラットフォームを活用して、世界で最も難しいなデータに関する課題を解決できるよう支援することをミッションとしています。デリバリーソリューションアーキテクト（DSA）は、この重要なミッションにおいて、セールスおよびフィールド・エンジニアリングチームと協力し、お客様のDatabricksプラットフォームの導入と利用拡大を加速させる重要な役割を担います。DSAとして、お客様がすでに導入を決定したDatabricksのワークロードについて、お客様がプラットフォームから最大限の価値と投資対効果を得られるよう、技術的な指導とサポートを提供し、お客様の成功を確実にします。特に、複雑な課題を抱えるお客様に対して、より重点的かつ技術的な責任を持って支援を行います。&lt;br&gt;このポジションは、技術とビジネスの両面を兼ね備えたハイブリッドな役割です。担当するお客様とユースケースにおいて、成長を推進します。ビジネス面では、お客様の意思決定者と関係を構築し、他の専門チームと連携しながら、Databricksが実行できる計画や戦略を策定・推進します。技術面ではDatabricksの全製品における、お客様導入後の技術的なリーダーとなります。組織内のあらゆるレベルの人々と、技術的な専門知識を活かしてコミュニケーションをとる能力が求められます。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;あなたがもたらす影響 :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;戦略的アカウントにおける複雑なユースケースおよび複数のワークストリーム全体で、技術的な実行戦略を定義し、影響を与える。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;お客様のテクニカルリードやアーキテクトにとって信頼される技術アドバイザーとなり、アーキテクチャの議論をリードし、技術的な意思決定をガイドする。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;パフォーマンス、コスト、信頼性、長期的なニーズのバランスを取りながら、安全かつガバナンスの効いたスケーラブルなDatabricksアーキテクチャを設計する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;お客様の成果を加速させる実用的なソリューション、プロトタイプ、再利用可能な技術資産を構築・実証する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;プラットフォームの成熟度とスケーリングのニーズを予測し、セキュリティ、ガバナンス、運用の卓越性に関するベストプラクティスを確立する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;アーキテクチャに影響を与え、デリバリーの障害を取り除き、技術的な実行をビジネス成果に結びつけることで、プラットフォームの採用と利用を促進する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks、お客様、導入チームと連携し、リソースの調整、リスク管理、デリバリーの加速を行う。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;同僚を指導し、組織全体で活用できる再利用可能な技術ガイダンス、フレームワーク、およびイネーブルメントに貢献する。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;必要な条件/経験:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ソリューションアーキテクト、ソリューションエンジニアリング、技術コンサルティング、プロフェッショナルサービス、データエンジニアリング、または関連する技術的役割における5年以上の経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;複雑な顧客のユースケースや複数のワークストリーム全体で、技術戦略やアーキテクチャに影響を与えた経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python、SQL、または類似の言語における高いコーディング能力と、技術的ソリューションの構築、デバッグ、検証を行う能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;分散データシステム、データエンジニアリング、分析、データウェアハウジング、AI/ML、および最新のクラウドアーキテクチャに関する深い理解&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;安全でガバナンスが効き、スケーラブルかつ本番環境に対応したデータソリューションを設計した経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;不明確な技術的問題を解決し、トレードオフを評価し、構造化された分析や実験を通じてソリューションを検証する能力&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;技術リード、アーキテクト、および顧客のシニアステークホルダーとのアーキテクチャ議論をリードした経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;セキュリティ、ガバナンス、パフォーマンス、信頼性、コスト最適化など、プラットフォームの運用上の卓越性に関する深い理解&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;技術的リーダーシップを通じて、顧客の採用、利用、そして測定可能なビジネス成果を促進した実績&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;強力なステークホルダーマネジメントおよび部門横断的なリーダーシップスキル（正式な権限なしでチームを調整する能力を含む）&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;コンピュータサイエンス、工学、または同等の分野における学士号&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;日本語の完全な専門的習熟度が必須&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;望ましい経験/スキル&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricksの経験または認定資格&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/ML、データエンジニアリング、ストリーミング、データウェアハウジング、ガバナンス、マイグレーションなどの技術分野における専門知識の構築&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS、Azure、またはGCPおよび本番環境でのクラウドデプロイメントの経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;チーム全体で活用できる、再利用可能な技術フレームワーク、デモ、またはイネーブルメント（支援策）を作成した経験&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ビジネスレベルの英語力があれば尚可&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;選考プロセス:&lt;/strong&gt; Recruiter Screen → Hiring Manager Screen → Design &amp;amp; Architecture → Vibe Coding → Build, Demo &amp;amp; Delivery → Reference Check&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;出張:&lt;/strong&gt; 必要に応じて最大30%程度&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive your mission will be to help further build our India business, which is one of our fastest growing markets in APJ. The Databricks Sales Team is driving growth through strategic and innovative partnership with our customers, helping businesses thrive by solving the world&#39;s toughest problems with our solutions. You will be inspiring and guiding customers on their data journey, making organisations more collaborative and productive than ever before. You will play an important role in the business in India, with the opportunity to strategically build your territory in close partnership with the business leaders. Using your passion with technology and drive to build, you will help businesses all across India reach their full potential, through the power of Databricks Data Intelligence Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You know how to sell innovation and change and can guide deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in-depth and are passionate about communicating its value to customers and partners. Always prospecting for new opportunities, you will close new accounts while growing our business in existing accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect for new customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess your existing customers and develop a strategy to identify and engage all buying centres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a solution approach to selling and creating value for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the most viable use cases in each account to maximise Databricks&#39; impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate and work with teams to maximise the impact of the Databricks ecosystem on your territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build value with all engagements to promote successful negotiations and close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote the Databricks enterprise cloud data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be customer-focused by delivering technical and business results using the Databricks&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote Teamwork&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have previously worked in an early-stage company and you know how to navigate and be successful in a fast-growing organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of sales experience in SaaS/PaaS, or Big Data companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior customer relationships with CIOs and important decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simply articulate intricate cloud technologies and big data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience exceeding sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success closing new accounts while upselling existing accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PLEASE NOTE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to federal contract requirements and client site access obligations, &lt;strong&gt;U.S. citizenship and eligibility for a U.S. government secret clearance are required&lt;/strong&gt; to access classified information. The position is based in the Washington, D.C., Maryland, or Virginia metropolitan area and includes periodic on‑site work and client collaboration. Candidates with an active Secret or higher clearance are strongly encouraged to apply.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AI Forward Deployed Engineering (AI FDE) team is a highly specialized customer-facing AI team at Databricks. We deliver professional services engagements to help our customers build and productionize first-of-its-kind AI applications. We work cross-functionally to shape long-term strategic priorities and initiatives alongside engineering, product, and developer relations, as well as support internal subject matter expert (SME) teams. We view our team as an ensemble: we look for individuals with strong, unique specializations to improve the overall strength of the team. This team is the right fit for you if you love working with customers, teammates, and fueling your curiosity for the latest trends in GenAI, LLMOps, and ML more broadly. This role can be remote.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2006&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop cutting-edge GenAI solutions, incorporating the latest techniques from &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/blog/category/databricks-ai?categories=databricks-ai%2Cai-research%2Cai-engineering&quot;&gt;Databricks AI research&lt;/a&gt; to solve customer problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own production rollouts of consumer and internally facing GenAI applications&lt;/li&gt;
